        <body>
            <div xml:id="d961">

                <pb facs="0989" n="869" sameAs="frus:frus1905/pg869"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Swedish Minister to the Secretary of
                    State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of Sweden</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1905-11-13"><hi rendition="#italic">November 13,
                        1905</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Mr. Secretary of State</hi>: The dissolution of the
                    union between Sweden and Norway being at present legally effected, His Majesty
                    King Oscar II has changed his official title for that of “King of Sweden, of the
                    Goths, and of the Vandals.”</p>
                <p>I have the honor, by order of my government, to inform your excellency of this,
                    and I take this occasion, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">A. Grip.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
